{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t即將舉行APEC峰會的深圳，被譽為「中國設計之都」。文化創意業亦是深圳四大支柱產業之一，佔全市GDP約8%。<br/>\n<br/>\n有進駐園區的香港藝術家說，深圳文化配套齊全，創作概念能夠很快變成作品；亦有設計師舉辦非物質文化遺產展覽，希望讓更多參加峰會的人認識中國文化。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:20:55.015985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:35:21.950543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:29.668701+00:00","content_hash":"bf0de78a615df1a7a064c3be9c5680d18843d205ccd54cc00202c6b14a5e92c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}